      <div class="art-body">
        <h2>What is QXBroker?</h2>
        <p>QXBroker (qxbroker.com) is the platform behind Quotex — one of the most widely used binary options trading platforms worldwide. It offers hundreds of trading pairs including currencies, commodities, stocks and cryptocurrencies, with payouts ranging from 70-95%.</p>
        <p>QXBroker is available 24/7 with OTC (Over The Counter) pairs, making it ideal for automated trading at any time of day or night.</p>
        <h2>Why Automate QXBroker Trading?</h2>
        <ul class="art-list">
