          <li><strong>Speed:</strong> Bot places trades faster than any human trader</li>
          <li><strong>Discipline:</strong> Automatically stops when take profit or stop loss is reached</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How Quotex Bot Works with QXBroker</h2>
        <p>Quotex Bot is a Chrome extension specifically designed for the QXBroker platform. It integrates directly with the browser interface without any API access — which means it works even when platforms update their backend systems.</p>
        <p>The bot uses DOM monitoring (MutationObserver) to detect trade results in real time and immediately responds by placing the next trade according to your martingale sequence.</p>
