          <li><strong>GBP/NZD (OTC):</strong> Popular among bot traders for consistent volatility</li>
          <li><strong>AUD/CHF (OTC):</strong> Smooth price action, good for martingale</li>
          <li><strong>EUR/USD (OTC):</strong> Most liquid pair, low spread</li>
          <li><strong>BTC/USD:</strong> High volatility, higher risk but higher payout potential</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>QXBroker Auto Trading Setup — Step by Step</h2>
        <ul class="art-list">
          <li>Go to chrome.google.com/webstore and install Quotex Bot</li>
          <li>Open qxbroker.com and select demo or live account</li>
          <li>Choose a trading pair — start with USD/PKR OTC for 24/7 availability</li>
          <li>Open the Quotex Bot sidebar (click extension icon)</li>
          <li>Select your preset and configure risk management</li>
          <li>Click Start Trading — bot begins automatically</li>
        </ul>
